  "body": "Freestanding end unit. Quiet street. High spec finish.\r\n\r\nTitle CCC issued. Move-in ready.\r\n\r\nApprox floor area 189sqm more or less. 10 years Stamford Insurance Warranty gives peace of mind.\r\n\r\n• 3 bedrooms | 3 ensuites | Internal garage\r\n• Ground floor ensuite (ideal guests)\r\n• Designer modern kitchen with Miele appliances\r\n• Sunny open-plan living to a private balcony\r\n• Double glazing + heat pump comfort\r\n\r\nSet in one of Orakei’s top streets, this home ticks all the boxes for modern, low maintenance living. Clean lines, quality build, and smart layout with great separation for family or guests.\r\n\r\nUpstairs offers two generous ensuite bedrooms with leafy outlooks. Downstairs adds flexibility with a full bedroom and bathroom.\r\n\r\nClose to beaches, cafes, parks and an easy run to the CBD.\r\n\r\nSharp buying, keen vendors – act quick, this won’t last.",
